{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05428","headline":"折柳篇 · 许景先","name":"折柳篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春色东来度渭桥，青门垂柳百千条。\n长杨西连建章路，汉家林苑纷无数。\n萦花始遍合欢枝，游丝半罥相思树。\n春楼初日照南隅，柔条垂绿扫金铺。\n宝钗新梳倭堕髻，锦带交垂连理襦。\n自怜柳塞淹戎幕，银烛长啼愁梦着。\n芳树朝催玉管新，春风夜染罗衣薄。\n城头杨柳已如丝，今年花落去年时。\n折芳远寄相思曲，爲惜容华难再持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许景先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}